[
  {
    "title": "Computing Bias & Crowdsourcing",
    "tag": "LESSON 28",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 6 · Impact of Computing",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Whose Data?<br>Whose Voice?</h1><p class=\"zh\">计算偏差 · 代表性 · 众包 · 公民科学</p><p class=\"small\">Community Shade Map · a fictional case · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "承接L27虚构地图：有参与机会仍不等于会参加，更不等于代表全体。本课所有人数和报告率都是构造模型，North/South仅为虚构地区标签，不对应真实城市或人口群体。保护42–72分钟调查。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve access and data quality",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.C · DAT-2",
    "html": "<ol><li>Does removing access barriers guarantee participation?</li><li>Does a larger voluntary sample guarantee representation?</li><li>Can a correctly computed average support a weak claim?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">No; no; yes. A correct calculation can summarize a biased or unsuitable input sample.</div></details>",
    "note": "与L27出口衔接。第三问提醒数据质量、抽样和解释不是程序算术正确性自动保证的。学生先给理由再显示答案，避免把“偏差”理解成仅代码运行错误。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Evaluate a crowd, not just its size",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D–E",
    "html": "<ol><li>Locate bias in data, design and use.</li><li>Compare sample composition with a target population.</li><li>Explain crowdsourcing and citizen science.</li><li>Propose quality checks and state their limits.</li></ol>",
    "note": "目标不是训练机器学习模型，也不引入某种唯一公平公式。加权是理解构成偏差的教学工具；官方核心为计算偏差与规模协作。术语会放进同一调查中的判断任务。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Bias can enter at several stages",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "8–11 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Human choices shape data collection, design rules and deployment; bias can be introduced at any of these stages.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Data</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Who is recorded?</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Design</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">What is rewarded?</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Use</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Where is it used?</text></svg></figure><p>Computing can reflect existing human bias through data and algorithms.</p>",
    "note": "数据可能漏掉某些人；规则可能把频繁提交误当更大需求；使用者可能把旧地区模型直接套到新地区。各层都有人作决定。不能把偏差只归给故意歧视，或认为程序员善意就不存在偏差。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Data bias: who is absent?",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "11–14 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"In the fictional map, app-only collection excludes non-users, creating a risk of uneven coverage in the data.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 165\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"350\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Fictional collection</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">App users only</text><path d=\"M375 82H448\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M446 75L460 82L446 89Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"470\" y=\"15\" width=\"330\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"635\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Missing voices</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Non-users</text><path d=\"M810 82H878\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M876 75L890 82L876 89Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"900\" y=\"15\" width=\"285\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1042\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Risk</text><text x=\"1042\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Uneven coverage</text></svg></figure><p>A sample can be large while repeatedly missing the same people.</p><details><summary>Show why size alone is insufficient</summary><div class=\"answer\">Collecting more reports from the same reachable users may preserve the gap.</div></details>",
    "note": "North/South只是后续可见组别，不代表全部重要差异。某组内部也可能只包括愿意回复、在特定时段在线的人。更多数据可减少某些随机波动，但不会自动修复系统性的覆盖缺口。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Design bias: what does a rule reward?",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "14–17 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A fictional design that ranks raw report counts may reward repeated submissions from highly active users instead of greatest need.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Design rule</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Rank report count</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Possible effect</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Reward repetition</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Risk</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Mistake activity for need</text></svg></figure><p>Ask whether the chosen measure matches the intended purpose.</p><details><summary>Show a design review</summary><div class=\"answer\">Separate valid reports about different places from duplicates; then test whether the ranking still misses needs.</div></details>",
    "note": "不把所有重复观察直接删除：同一地点的不同时间或不同有效观测可能有价值。先定义分析单位，检查同一报告重复提交，再谈排序。分数是人选择的代理指标，不等于需求本身。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use bias: a model travels into a new context",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "17–20 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D.3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A fictional rule based on daytime park users is applied to evening bus-stop users, whose needs require a separate evaluation.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Original context</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Daytime parks</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">New deployment</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Evening bus stops</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Needed check</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Test local fit</text></svg></figure><p>A correct implementation can still be unsuitable for a new population or task.</p>",
    "note": "上下文迁移例为假设，不声称任一真实群体需求特征。新地点、时段和任务需要检验，不能只靠原测试通过。也不要说使用层偏差必然发生；是需要评价的风险。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Reduce bias, then check again",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "20–23 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D.2–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bias mitigation involves finding a gap, changing a relevant cause and evaluating the result again; it does not guarantee elimination.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 160\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"350\" height=\"130\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Find a gap</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">Compare groups</text><path d=\"M375 80H443\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M441 73L455 80L441 87Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"465\" y=\"15\" width=\"340\" height=\"130\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"635\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Change a cause</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">Data / rule / access</text><path d=\"M815 80H883\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M881 73L895 80L881 87Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"905\" y=\"15\" width=\"280\" height=\"130\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1045\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Re-evaluate</text><text x=\"1045\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">New evidence</text></svg></figure><p>Consult affected users, improve coverage, and compare outcomes.</p><details><summary>Test one proposed shortcut</summary><div class=\"answer\">Removing a group label does not guarantee removal of related signals or sampling gaps.</div></details>",
    "note": "减少偏差要有可检查的步骤。隐去地区标签并不把样本构成改成代表人口，也不移除其它与地区相关的信号。强调标签可用于发现分组差异，如何收集管理需结合后续隐私课，不为了本课随意要求更多个人资料。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Crowdsourcing gathers many people’s input",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "23–26 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.E.1/4–5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Many people contribute observations through the Internet to a shared collection that supports collaborative problem solving.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Many people</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Observations</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Internet</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared collection</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Collaboration</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Review and solve</text></svg></figure><p>众包: obtaining input or information from many people via the Internet.</p>",
    "note": "强调规模协作的结构：贡献者通过网络提供内容，平台聚合便于识别问题、共同解决和传播结果。人数多是机会而非正确保证。可用开放共享信息促成协作，但“公众可看见”不等于没有使用规则，L30会继续。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Citizen science and distributed computing",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "26–30 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.E.2–3 · CSN-2 retrieval",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Citizen science involves people contributing to scientific research, often collecting data; distributed computing shares computational work across computers.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 180\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"560\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">Online citizen science</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"101\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">People collect observations</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">For scientific research</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"15\" width=\"560\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Distributed computing</text><text x=\"905\" y=\"101\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Computers share tasks</text><text x=\"905\" y=\"139\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">For computation</text></svg></figure><p>Non-scientists can contribute relevant data using their own devices.</p><details><summary>Apply the distinction</summary><div class=\"answer\">A shade study with a shared measurement protocol could be citizen science. The two approaches can also be combined.</div></details>",
    "note": "不是所有众包意见调查都是科学研究。若虚构项目设计成标准化遮阴测量研究，分布式参与者用自己的设备贡献相关数据，即可作为公民科学例。多电脑分任务是第五章计算架构，不能把二者混同，也不能说二者互斥。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Scale creates opportunities and checks",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "30–34 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.E.1/5–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A crowd can expand geographic coverage, a platform can combine contributions, and collaborators can share solutions, but each stage needs quality checks.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Coverage</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Many places</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Combination</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Shared evidence</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Result</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Share solutions</text></svg></figure><p>Computing can also coordinate contributions to fund a project or social cause.</p><details><summary>Show the tradeoff</summary><div class=\"answer\">More contributors can widen coverage; participation still depends on access, motivation and a usable process.</div></details>",
    "note": "此处众筹说明新的协作融资模式，符合E.6；不要声称众包必须涉及资金。人工标注、观察记录、开放协作都可能扩展人的能力，但需要可比较的数据和审核。与前页计算机分担工作区分。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build quality checks into the process",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "34–38 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.E · data quality application",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A crowd-data workflow provides a clear observation protocol, validates entries and audits a sample against independent evidence.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 165\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"15\" width=\"340\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Before collection</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">Clear protocol</text><path d=\"M365 83H443\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M441 76L455 83L441 90Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"465\" y=\"15\" width=\"340\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"635\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">During collection</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">Validate entries</text><path d=\"M815 83H883\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M881 76L895 83L881 90Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"905\" y=\"15\" width=\"280\" height=\"135\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1045\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">After collection</text><text x=\"1045\" y=\"103\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">Audit a sample</text></svg></figure><p>Retain source, place, time and method when relevant to interpretation.</p><details><summary>Distinguish two checks</summary><div class=\"answer\">A valid format does not prove a report is true; independent checks test a different kind of quality.</div></details>",
    "note": "输入校验检验格式、范围和缺项，不能证明地点真的缺阴。可用抽样现场核查或独立来源对照，但仍需注意两来源共享误差。元数据的目的为解释与追溯，避免采集不必要的个人识别信息；不提前代替L29隐私课。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A sample mix can differ from its target",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "38–42 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D · model setup",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Synthetic target population is60percent North and40percent South, while the default sample is80percent North and20percent South.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 181\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Target population</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"15\" width=\"480\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830\" y=\"15\" width=\"320\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"590\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" font-weight=\"700\">60% N</text><text x=\"990\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" font-weight=\"700\">40% S</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Collected sample</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"108\" width=\"640\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"990\" y=\"108\" width=\"160\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><text x=\"670\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" font-weight=\"700\">80% N</text><text x=\"1070\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" font-weight=\"700\">20% S</text></svg></figure><p>Fictional labels: North and South. A larger bar shows a larger share of the same total.</p>",
    "note": "横轴两个条都代表100%，蓝色North、绿色South，颜色没有好坏含义。学生先判断哪组在样本中占比偏多，不立即推出需求方向；下一页活动会提供各组固定报告率。这个构成差异是可见问题，不是全部偏差。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Investigation: test the crowd’s conclusion",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE",
    "time": "42–47 min",
    "code": "30-minute investigation · 1 / 5",
    "html": "<p><strong>Fictional model:</strong> North is 60% of the population; South is 40%. Fixed “more shade needed” report rates are 20% and 80% respectively.</p><ol><li>Compare three sample compositions.</li><li>Calculate a rate using the population mix.</li><li>Design inclusion and quality checks; state a remaining limit.</li></ol><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"Chapter_6_Impact_Lab.html#bias\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Bias lab</a> · Use paper or a calculator.</p>",
    "note": "42–72完整30分钟。固定报告率是假定组内报告倾向，不是现实测量或真实需求比例。North样本人数滑块5–95步长5，其余South，总100。每组轮换预测和检验。交三行数据表、加权计算、限定结论和众包检查方案。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Baseline: compute the sample rate",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE",
    "time": "47–52 min",
    "code": "30-minute investigation · 2 / 5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"For the synthetic baseline sample, calculate80times0.20 North reports and20times0.80 South reports, then divide their sum by100.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 175\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"12\" width=\"560\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">North: 80 sampled</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Report rate: 20%</text><text x=\"295\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">Expected reports: 80 × 0.20</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"12\" width=\"560\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">South: 20 sampled</text><text x=\"905\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Report rate: 80%</text><text x=\"905\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"400\">Expected reports: 20 × 0.80</text></svg></figure><p>Add expected reports, then divide by all <strong>100</strong> sampled people.</p><details><summary>Check your calculation</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>16 + 16 = 32; sample rate = 32%.</strong> This is a synthetic model calculation, not an observed survey.</div></details>",
    "note": "先算分组数量再合计，不能平均20%和80%得到50%而忽略人数不等。实验室用“报告数”显示的整数依然来自假定率的构造值；不能描述为真受访者原始记录。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Change composition; hold group rates fixed",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE",
    "time": "52–58 min",
    "code": "30-minute investigation · 3 / 5",
    "html": "<p>Test these North / South sample counts:</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"font-size:48px\">80 / 20 → 60 / 40 → 40 / 60</p><p>Predict each total rate. What changes, and what stays fixed?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>32% → 44% → 56%.</strong> The sample mix changes; North 20% and South 80% report rates stay fixed.</div></details>",
    "note": "6分钟。每次先写预测再动滑块，记固定组内率这一控制条件。同样的地区报告率却不同总体样本率，说明构成影响汇总。不能据此声称South一定代表更真实的数据，目标人口仍是60/40。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Use population shares as weights",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE",
    "time": "58–64 min",
    "code": "30-minute investigation · 4 / 5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The population-mix adjusted model rate combines North’s20percent report rate with a60percent weight and South’s80percent rate with a40percent weight.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 145\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">North contribution</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">0.60 × 0.20</text><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">South contribution</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">0.40 × 0.80</text><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"121\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Combine</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Add the products</text></svg></figure><p>Compare this result with all three sample rates.</p><details><summary>Check the population-mix result</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>0.12 + 0.32 = 0.44 = 44%.</strong> It stays fixed because population shares and group rates are fixed.</div></details>",
    "note": "6分钟。此工具展示按人口构成加权，不是官方要求的某种唯一“消偏算法”。在固定组内率前提下不随样本滑块改变；只改不同地区占比这一层。不能把44%称为实际总人口需求的已知真值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Build a better collection plan",
    "tag": "INVESTIGATE",
    "time": "64–72 min",
    "code": "30-minute investigation · 5 / 5",
    "html": "<ol><li>State the sample-mix finding with two numbers.</li><li>Explain one bias the weighting does not address.</li><li>Propose an inclusion step and a matched quality check.</li><li>Identify evidence that would test your revised plan.</li></ol><details><summary>Compare one possible plan</summary><div class=\"answer\">Possible plan: support more ways to contribute, use a shared shade-observation protocol, and audit a sample. Within-group nonresponse or inaccurate reports can remain.</div></details>",
    "note": "最后8分钟保留结论写作和互评。更多渠道的记录仍应采用可比较定义；不要预言渠道一加就代表全体。具体限制可为组内非响应、自选、测量误差、假定率不符合现实。8教师分：三次汇总2、加权计算1、限定结论1、残留偏差1、包容行动1、质量行动1、验证证据1。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check the claim about weighting",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "time": "72–76 min",
    "code": "Original AP-style practice",
    "html": "<p>Population-mix weighting gives 44% in the fictional model. Which conclusion is justified?</p><p class=\"small\">A. Every form of bias has been removed.<br>B. The result adjusts for the stated group shares under fixed rates.<br>C. Every real resident needs more shade.<br>D. The raw sample must have included 60 North residents.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>B.</strong> A overclaims; C invents a population fact; D confuses weights with actual sample counts.</div></details>",
    "note": "要求解释D为何错误：权重使用人口构成，不会回头修改实际样本来源。若学生选择A，让他举出同一地区内部只有某时段的人回复的反例。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Select exactly TWO justified claims",
    "tag": "CHECK",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "Original AP-style practice",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">A. Crowdsourcing can collect input through the Internet at scale.<br>B. More volunteers guarantee an unbiased sample.<br>C. Citizen science can include non-scientists contributing research data.<br>D. Format validation proves every observation is accurate.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>A and C.</strong> B confuses scale with representation. D confuses valid format with verified content.</div></details>",
    "note": "注意公民科学研究属性，不把所有收集评分或意见都直接贴科学标签。可要求学生把D改成合理话：格式校验可发现某些无效输入，但需其它检查评价观察准确性。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Make evidence and uncertainty travel together",
    "tag": "DEBRIEF",
    "time": "80–84 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D–E · evidence brief",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An evidence brief reports how data were collected, what the model comparison shows and what remains uncertain.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Provenance</text><text x=\"193.33333333333334\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">Who and how?</text><path d=\"M378.6666666666667 75.0H401.6666666666667\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M399.6666666666667 68.0L413.6666666666667 75.0L399.6666666666667 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"421.6666666666667\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Finding</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">What changed?</text><path d=\"M785.3333333333334 75.0H808.3333333333334\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M806.3333333333334 68.0L820.3333333333334 75.0L806.3333333333334 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"828.3333333333334\" y=\"12\" width=\"356.6666666666667\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Limit</text><text x=\"1006.6666666666667\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">What remains?</text></svg></figure><p>Shared results should include the method, assumptions and relevant limits.</p><details><summary>Show a bounded brief</summary><div class=\"answer\">The model sample rate changes from 32% to 56% when composition changes. The adjusted 44% uses fixed group rates; it does not verify real needs.</div></details>",
    "note": "请学生用一句话读数字证据，再用一句话读限制，不把不确定性藏进脚注。来源元数据与可重复方法便于协作者检验。Crowdsourcing扩大合作能力，计算程序处理规模，但都不能自动保证有效结论。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework: diagnose, calculate, improve",
    "tag": "HOMEWORK",
    "time": "84–87 min",
    "code": "12 original questions · 30 teacher marks",
    "html": "<p>Complete the Lesson 28 homework.</p><ul><li>Q1–6: original AP-style MCQs; Q5 selects exactly TWO.</li><li>Q7–12: explain causes, calculations, checks and limits.</li><li>North / South and every numerical result are synthetic.</li></ul><p class=\"small\"><a href=\"#homework\">Open homework</a> · <a href=\"output/pdf/AP_CSP_L28_Homework.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Print student PDF</a></p>",
    "note": "书面题不要求复杂统计或机器学习算法，算术通过展开乘积即可。重视“这项措施解决什么、还不能解决什么”两部分。Q1/Q6提取前章数据及L27参与机制。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit: a crowd is a source, not a guarantee",
    "tag": "EXIT",
    "time": "87–90 min",
    "code": "IOC-1.D–E",
    "html": "<ol><li>Name two stages where computing bias may enter.</li><li>Explain why 44% is not a verified real-world need rate.</li><li>Give one quality check for citizen-science data.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Data collection, design or use. The 44% depends on synthetic shares and fixed group rates. A shared protocol plus an independent sample audit can test data quality.</div></details>",
    "note": "第一问任意两阶段但最好附例；第二问必须说出假设或未覆盖偏差；第三问不接受只有“检查数据”，要求具体做法。下一课将讨论数字隐私与安全，再在L30讨论贡献内容的负责使用与署名。"
  }
]
